### AC8-D — RIB (remand in custody with bail direction) + PREBC → NO error
# RIB is the suggested correction, not itself a conditional bail parent.
# Expected: isValid=true, no DR-BAIL-015 issue.
POST {{validateUrl}}
Content-Type: application/json
CJSCPPUID: {{userId}}
CPP-ACTION: validation-service.validate

