# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# NOTE — Null hearingDay (defensive guard, unit-tested only)
#
# hearingDay is a required field in the API schema. When it is absent the
# service returns HTTP 400 Bad Request before the PreReleaseBailConditionPreprocessor
# is ever reached, so this scenario cannot be exercised via HTTP.
#
# The null-hearingDay → hasDob=0 → AC_NODOB (Error C) path in the preprocessor
# is a defensive layer only reachable programmatically. It is covered at:
#   Unit:  PreReleaseBailConditionPreprocessorTest
#          .nullHearingDay_withNonNullDob_shouldSetHasDobZeroRoutingToNoDobPath
#   IT:    PreReleaseBailConditionRuleIT.MissingHearingDay
#          .validate_should_return_400_when_hearing_day_is_absent
#   API:   PreReleaseBailConditionApiHttpLiveTest.MissingHearingDay
#          .missingHearingDay_should_returnBadRequest
#
# To manually verify the 400 boundary, omit "hearingDay" from any request above.
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

###
